Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:05.28,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Mechanical friends, Amicus Robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:08.40,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,A general name for androids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:12.49,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Amicus are imprinted\Nwith the Laws of Respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:14.62,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,To respect human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:17.50,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,To be obedient to human commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:20.58,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,To never attack a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:58.37,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,You're the first Amicus I've seen\Nwho was moved by listening to Tchaikovsky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.37,0:01:59.52,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:02.02,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Yes, very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:05.02,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,We're going home, Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Darya, Harold, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.45,0:02:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, perfectly fine.\NHow's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from the Bereaved Family\NAssociation is here to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The leader, Mr. Abaev.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom organized his things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's anything you want to take,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.11,0:02:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I read this book when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he has it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did your mom start\Ncleaning out her things?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:02.83,Default Above,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:04.83,Default Above,,0,0,0,,I don't think she's been diagnosed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:06.62,Default Above,,0,0,0,,with a serious illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She still has extreme mood swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Her current medication is helping,\Nbut it messes with her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the information packet\Nfor the grief care company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from the largest company, Derevo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's doctor recommended them,\Nso I got their information.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're throwing it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She went into one of her\Nhysterical episodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure she understood your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be difficult for her\Nto have her son worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. After all,\Nit has only been two and a half years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Two and a half years, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like it was just yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena, don't think too much about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your medicine\Nand focus on your treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come visit you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena, thank you for your get-well gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought that thing here?\NYou still haven't gotten rid of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.\NI asked him to come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize.\NWe will be taking our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare talk to me,\Nyou useless robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You just watched as he was killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Elena—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting Sozon's clothes\Non this piece of junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think this thing\Ncan replace my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,then you've got no right\Nstepping into my home, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the living room\Nand take your medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:05:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw them out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Darya, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Harold, I think of you\Nas a real little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I also think of you as my real family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take Elena's words to heart, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I should have worn\Nmy own clothes instead of Sozon's today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.\NYou are not a replacement for Sozon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You are you.\NYou can wear whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to use Sozon's car or room.\NSo go back to your room...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Darya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this because I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sozon and I have similar preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I especially like the Lada Niva,\Nso I do not want to replace it just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you complain it is uncomfortable\Nto ride in, I want to continue driving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let us go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tosti was released as an open-source\Nsoftware at one point,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so anyone aside from the Robin siblings\Ncould have installed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Find all the installed Tosti programs,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and continue your efforts in\Ninvestigating Alan Jack Lascelles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Chief Totoki appoint him as\Nthe head of the special investigation unit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Support Unit has been involved in\Ninvestigating E for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She probably thought he'd be a good fit\Nconsidering his career history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at him, he most likely\Nonly ate three pancakes this morning—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It was two.\NAren't you supposed to know everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:07:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a high-performance android indeed,\Nbut nothing is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call yourself high-performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Fokine, is Tosti's source code\Nbeing re-analyzed again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The code doesn't match\Nthe program's capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So the real source code\Nis hidden somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we can quickly find the hidden door\Nthat leads to the real code.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be easier if we could break it open\Nlike the door to the electrical room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you accurately shoot and break\Nthe hinges of the door in that fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not everyone can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.81,0:07:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I barely remember what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.85,0:07:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber-Inspector, Bigga has arrived\Nand is waiting at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Bigga my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We were able to confiscate two more\NTosti programs thanks to her advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Harold, Hieda!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. How was your training?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was kind of rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The crime scene photos in the files\Nwere very grotesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm finally an official consultant\Nfor the Investigation Support Unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Fokine said thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we wouldn't have thought of\Nthe idea of using Tosti
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to analyze a patient's chart and selling\Nthe collected statistics to Bio-hackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give this to Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you'll like it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:09:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NMay I open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is for you, Hieda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nutritional jelly drinks? You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You both helped me so much,\Nbut I couldn't return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's a bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But Hieda, you can tell the difference\Nbetween the jelly's flavors, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought the ham was cheese\Nwhen you had that sandwich in Hermitage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was cheese, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No. It was really ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Anyway, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You said your scarf\Nhas become very frayed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so I thought you could use a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the gift.\NI'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you learn to act\Nlike such a scoundrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a horrible thing\Nto say to your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You should say I was being sociable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were the definition of "sociable,"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,then without a doubt,\NI'd become a hermit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never leave my house either
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,if you became the standard\Nfor people's sense of taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are always together\Nduring work hours, are we not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.43,0:10:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off work right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, it means we are always together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unrelated to\Nthe special investigations unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But can you stop by the police\Nheadquarters tomorrow morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:11:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to speak with Cyber-inspection\NAssistant Lucraft about a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you used to work there,\Nyou are now with the CID,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'd like you to go with Hieda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they received a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,From Detective Sozon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask you to come\Nso early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Chief Napolov.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a chief anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked to be demoted,\Ndid you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found yourself a new partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Being single is nice and comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming,\NCyber-Inspector Hieda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time we received a call\Nfrom Sozon was about two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Two weeks ago?\NWhy did you not inform me until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a bad prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But we got another call yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's something we can't ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:12.42,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,How are you? It's been a while.\NI see two and a half years already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:16.77,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Sozon?! That can't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:17.59,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:20.49,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm honored you remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:24.22,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,How could I forget? But what...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:26.06,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:27.58,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:33.90,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I want to find my killer.\NBut I can't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:36.96,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,So find him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The call came from a public phone\Nlocated in the designated dead zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He picked a spot\Nwith no security cameras in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the second call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:56.59,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Inspector Napolov.\NWhy haven't you found my killer yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:13:00.58,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,It's too bad you've turned even\Nyour own subordinates into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:05.20,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,You will all have another nightmare one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Nightmare of Petersburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but this means we need to treat this\Nas a police threat and look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I called you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the voice analysis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Forensics said it was his real voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But, as you already know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sozon was killed right before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a deep fake recording
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,since I was able to have\Nan actual conversation with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he changed his voice\Nin real-time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's possible. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The caller wants to remind us\Nof The Nightmare of Petersburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's too early to say\Nthe caller is The Nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:14:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. The Nightmare\Ndid not leave any clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the caller was\Nimpersonating Sozon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it was too reckless of them\Nto directly call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Napolov?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There has been a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A passerby discovered him\Nearly this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All four limbs are cut off and the head\Nis set on the dismembered torso.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly resembles\NThe Nightmare of Petersburg's signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.07,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, give him five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I also want to know what Harold thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a copycat.\NThe killer is not The Nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the victim is an Amicus?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The killer shut this Amicus Robot down\Nbefore dismembering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably to prevent him\Nfrom feeling any pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,However, The Nightmare is a Luddite\Naccording to Sozon's profiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.89,0:15:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They would not have shown such mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We should leave the investigation\Nto the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Harold. Is the killer the same as the caller\Nwho was impersonating Sozon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a high possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The caller predicted the return of\NThe Nightmare,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so it is consistent with this crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And this incident cannot be kept\Nfrom the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.19,Default Above,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:54.87,Default Above,,0,0,0,,The Nightmare of Petersburg
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.65,Default Above,,0,0,0,,will once again garner great attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:15:58.23,Default Above,,0,0,0,,The city's residents
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:15:59.61,Default Above,,0,0,0,,will begin to criticize...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:01.23,Default Above,,0,0,0,,Us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So the killer's intent is to use\Nthe public to put pressure on the police
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,to force us to reopen\NThe Nightmare of Petersburg case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As things stand,\Nthat is our best theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the killer knows\Nthe details of that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.95,0:16:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it must be a family member of a victim,\Nor a reporter...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shubin, did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Forensic Examiner Shubin,\NI'm relieved to see you have not changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can simply say you have no idea\Nwhat I'm thinking, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not speak of yourself like that.\NIt is a type of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector, will he be joining\Nthe investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just wanted Harold\Nto take a look at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.13,0:16:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Echika, I apologize for acting on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is an important case to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should leave it up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.\NWe still need to investigate Tosti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. This doesn't look like\NSt. Petersburg at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Fokine, is it really okay\Nfor me to come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your perspective was a big help with\Nconfiscating the Tosti programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Totoki also asked that I bring you out\Ninto the field as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hieda, did I cross the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. He's wearing his usual scarf today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:17:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he probably doesn't like\Nthe scarf I gave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, since I'm not his lover\Nor anything, so he'd hate it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.81,0:18:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be creeped out too, wouldn't you?\NI want to go back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked like he was\Nhappy about it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's not using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he wants to wear it\Nwhen he's not at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be nice if it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Inspector Fokine of\Nthe Cybercrime Investigation Department?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he an Amicus Robot?\NI can't tell at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.77,0:18:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All the customized models\Nhave different appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:58.86,Default Above,,0,0,0,,Our programs comply with all laws and guidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:01.19,Default Above,,0,0,0,,I don't think you will find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only taking a look as a precaution.\NI hope you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Find anything, Bigga?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If Tosti is hidden in here, I don't think\Nit will take long to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can your employees install\Nanalytic AI programs on their own?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They would create disparities\Nin the final digital clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.40,0:19:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you allow us to check\Nall of your employees' computers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bernard, can you help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's time for your break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'll be going home for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get dinner ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go straight home today,\Nokay, darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a charming manner of speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I special ordered him from a company\Nthat makes custom Amicus Robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Novae Robotics doesn't provide many options.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But with that company,\NI can modify the way he talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted him to be one of a kind\Nsince he will be my life partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That will soon be widely\Naccepted by society, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes three weeks\Nto create a digital clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Fokine,\NI do not mind your thoroughness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think this questioning\Nwill be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it could lead to an unexpected discovery.\NJust bear with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can wait dozens of hours if needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Data of the deceased are used\Nto make their digital clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.13,0:20:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All of it is kept offline\Nfor security reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you show me the contents?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:20:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's related to Tosti?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.89,0:21:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the records.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This did indeed lead to\Nan unexpected discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What discovery?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the digital clone for this\Ndeceased person completed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.87,0:21:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we handed it over to the client\Nabout two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Was the client Elena Alexavna Tchernova?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.03,0:21:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,However, was it really Elena\Nwho received it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.\NSomeone else came in her stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He had Ms. Tchernova's power of attorney\Nand we confirmed his identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.27,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who received the digital clone\Nwas Alexei Savich Abaev.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaev...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on your treatment. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come visit you again.
